  - CLI TEST_HOST/BUNDLE_LOADER override -> rejected: "TeslaSync-macOSUITests sets both
    USES_XCTRUNNER and either TEST_HOST or RUNTIME_TEST_HOST" (global override hits the UI-test target).
  - Host-less logic-test attempt (TEST_HOST="" + BUNDLE_LOADER=real binary) -> linker conflict:
    "...TeslaSync' not allowed with '-dynamiclib'".
  These are pre-existing harness/config issues outside this surface's scope (Allowed files:
  apps/apple/.../BackupMonitorWidget.* + this log); fixing the macOS scheme's test-host wiring
  belongs to P4 core / the project generator, not to a single dashboard-widget surface.

